    "description": "Title\n: Fossil Collection Science Education Kit 12 Identified Specimens Trilobite Shark\nDepartment\n: Science & Education\nCategory\n: Collectibles & Art\nCondition\n: Good - shows some sign of wear\nDescription\n: Explore Earth's ancient past with this 12-piece Fossil Collection Kit, perfect for science enthusiasts and collectors alike. Each fossil is individually bagged and accompanied by an educational card describing its origin and significance, including gastropods, pelycopods, horn coral, crinoid stems, brachiopods, trilobites, dinosaur bone, ammonites, fossil wood, algae, and shark teeth. The set includes a colorful timeline card mapping major periods of prehistoric life, making it a valuable educational tool. Ideal for students, teachers, or hobbyists, these fossils offer hands-on learning about natural history and paleontology. All items shown are included, and each fossil appears in its own clear, labeled packet for easy viewing and storage. The set is presented in good visible condition, with all key contents intact and readable. Delight in the tactile experience of real fossils and enrich your educational collection or science display with this fascinating assortment.\nThis is a pre-owned item donated to Goodwill of Northern Michigan.\nPlease see images for further detail and ask any questions you may have before making a bid.\nItems have been tested for power, not function. In some instances we may not have the necessary equipment to test certain electronics therefore all items will be auctioned off AS-IS with no refunds.\nItems in lots are sold as-is, are not eligible for refunds, and may not be individually wrapped.\nPlease contact us before making payment to review combined shipping options.\nPick-Ups\nWe're open Monday - Friday, 8 am - 4 pm. We are closed on weekends and major holidays. For local pickup in Traverse City, please give us 24 hours from time of payment to prepare your order. Thank you!",
